{"type":"message","id":"a3b54ed1","parentId":"069c2caa","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:00:40.849Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-05-26 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e622b9f34acee77abeb6315c72] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: [Replying to: \"⚠️ Cron job \"daily\\-backup\" failed: EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError: session file changed while embedded prompt lock was released: /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sess\n- Assistant: 查清楚了。说下情况： **daily-backup 失败链：** 1. ✅ `git add/commit` 成功 — 正常生成了 `auto backup 2026-05-25` 提交 2. ❌ `git push` 失败 — `fatal: could not read Username for 'https://github.com': No such device or address` 3. ❌ Agent 尝试回复错误信息时，MiniMax API 返回 `overloaded_error`（服务忙），重试也超时 4.\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e638092cca4eea1f1f9aaa34a1] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 能不能干活\n- Assistant: SSH key 已经存在了。改成 SSH\n- Assistant: SSH client 不在容器里\n- Assistant: 问题：容器里没装 SSH client 装不了，也没有 GitHub token 的环境变量。 需要你给我一个 **GitHub Personal Access Token**（或者配好的 SSH key 从宿主映射进来），我才能写凭证文件。 两种走法： **A. 丢个 GitHub Token 过来**（推荐，最省事） ```bash # 给我 token，我直接写： echo \"https://blocklee:${TOKEN}@github.com\" > ~/.git-credentials ``` **B. 把宿主 ~/.s\n- Session: 2026-05-21 19:23:49 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:lucus:feishu:lucus:direct:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a; **Session ID**: 4af9be2f-0106-4f73-b81d-699b0357495e; **Source**: feishu\n- assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fc17b7e8c68eea81920de3d7cd\", \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fdff63a3ca8ee8d450536ae34a\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a38